          "location": "orientation[1].text; decision_logic[0].action; common_traps[0].text",
          "problem": "The section states flatly that a dispensing pharmacist's inspection of a finished product does not supply either condition of 247 CMR 9.04(11), and that a final check of the product does not substitute. The regulation does not say this in terms; it is an inference from the words 'said process was verified'.",
